de specific teams if the only files changed were `SCsub`/`*.py`, as those had a flat `buildsystem` override. This was previously seen as an acceptable workaround, as implementing this explicitly would be tedious and hard to track down. While the former proved to be entirely true, the latter was addressed with expanded `validate_codeowners.py` functionality. Now, if an area of the engine is tagged/recognized with the appropriate \"strict\" ownership requirement, the CODEOWNERS validation will fail if that specific owner is not also included\n\n## Additional information\n\nLogic for `validate_codeowners.py` was further improved by resolving paths passed via arguments prior to parsing. This makes the hook operate better in a standalone context, as it will properly recognize paths with Windows-style separators and/or relative syntax","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"htt